# The read-only system values (QD2, QD7): a quad name without an
# underline is a value. []A is the alphabet, []D the digits, []AV every
# character (ASCII 0 to 127), []IO the index origin (always 1).
# []U_CS gives the codes of characters and []U_CHAR the characters of
# codes, one static type each (QD7).
== SOURCE
[]A
[]D
t_ally []AV
[]IO
[]U_CS "AB"
[]U_CHAR 72 105
[]U_CHAR []U_CS "abc"
([]U_CS "a") - []U_CS "A"
3 t_ake []A
